            "format": "text/html",
            "value": "",
            "frametrail:name": "His son, Pieter Brueghel the Younger, painted many copies. T",
            "frametrail:attributes": {
                "text": "&lt;div class=&quot;voiceNote&quot; data-voice=&quot;2&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;voiceName&quot;&gt;Art historian&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;His son, Pieter Brueghel the Younger, painted many copies. That is one reason the picture became so widely known.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;"
